{
  "id": "hydrocarbons__alcohols_and_acids___boiling_points",
  "title": "Hydrocarbons, Alcohols and Acids - Boiling Points",
  "description": "Calculator tool for boiling points of hydrocarbons, alcohols, and carboxylic acids. Select the compound type and carbon number to determine the boiling point in both Celsius and Fahrenheit.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Boiling Point Lookup\n\nThis tool provides boiling point data for various hydrocarbons, alcohols, and carboxylic acids based on carbon number and compound type.\n\n**Compound Types:**\n- Alkanes (2,2-dimethylalkane, 2-methylalkane, 3-methylalkane, N-alkane)\n- Alkenes (2-methylalkene, 1-alkene)\n- Alkynes (1-alkyne)\n- Cyclic compounds (Alkylcyclohexane, Alkylcyclopentane, Cycloalkene, Cycloalkane)\n- Aromatic compounds (Alkylbenzene, 1-alkylnaphthalene)\n- Alcohols (1-alkanol, 2-alkanol, 3-alkanol, 4-alkanol)\n- Carboxylic acids (Alkanoic acid)"
    },
